08:58:16  == Your files
08:58:16  Chat Computer can't open macOS's own files: on this Mac they're always encrypted, with keys only macOS can use
08:58:16  (FileVault or not). So setup copies the folders you choose onto a drive called ChatComp that both systems open;
08:58:16  macOS keeps its own copies. What you save on that drive in Chat Computer is in macOS too, and you can send more
08:58:16  later (run setup again).
08:58:16  macOS may ask whether Terminal can open your Desktop, Documents and Downloads folders: choose OK.
